{"url": "（本地文件）017、第十七节  综合训练：提升独立描述的综合能力.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\017、第十七节  综合训练：提升独立描述的综合能力.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 11.54, "text": "在第17节开始前,为了照顾所有学员的运用量,避免速度太快,我在这里再把第16节课的,包括16节课之前的知识,做一个小小的书面练习,这个只会占用5分钟,然后我们就正式进入Lesson 17,我们回顾一下Lesson 16。", "end": 37.54}, {"start": 42.66, "text": "A part of a leg? Yes, it is a part of a leg. Legs. Knees. Feet. Right? They are all parts of a leg. Is a toe a part of a hand? Is a toe a part of a hand? Head, shoulder, knees and toes. Oh, toes are part of our feet. They are not part of our hand.", "end": 72.91}, {"start": 72.91, "text": "No, a toe is not part of a hand. Are our necks parts of our faces? Are our necks parts of our faces? No, necks are parts of our body, not part of our face. No, necks are not part of our face.", "end": 104.29}, {"start": 104.29, "text": "Where is your chin? Your chin is on your face, under your mouth.", "end": 116.34}, {"start": 116.34, "text": "也可以说below,必存在,low,低处,在他之下,低处也可以叫below,我们这里说under就好了,教材也学的是under,right? My chin is under my mouth, on my face.", "end": 134.94}, {"start": 134.94, "text": "Is a chest of a drawers a thing? A chest of a drawers?不是a chest of a man,是a chest of a drawer. Drawer. Is it a thing or a person? It's a thing.不是人, not a person. It's a thing. So yes, a chest of a drawer is a thing. Yes.", "end": 160.96}, {"start": 160.96, "text": "看一下拼写,这是复合运用了,各位。 Is a toe a part of a hand? No, it is a part of a foot. Are our necks parts of our faces? Your are.", "end": 174.46}, {"start": 174.46, "text": "负数的我们的就是ours,你们的yours,right? Are our necks parts of our faces? No, our necks are not parts of our faces.说来也简单,人问啥答啥,right? Where is your chin? My chin is under my mouth.", "end": 199.68}, {"start": 199.68, "text": "Is a chest of drawers a thing? Yes, a chest of drawers is a thing. A chest, 就是中间那一格,right? Is a thing.", "end": 212.68}, {"start": 212.68, "text": "Is a chest a part of a body? Is a chest part of our body? Yes, a chest is part of our body.", "end": 220.68}, {"start": 220.68, "text": "Are your eyes part of your face? Yes, your eyes are parts of your face.", "end": 238.14}, {"start": 238.14, "text": "Is your nose over your eyes? No, your nose is under your eyes.", "end": 248.74}, {"start": 248.74, "text": "Are your ears parts of your head? Yes, your ears are parts of your head.", "end": 261.3}, {"start": 261.3, "text": "What is the part of a man which is between his head, his arms, and his legs?", "end": 285.89}, {"start": 285.89, "text": "What is the part of a man which is between his head, his arms, and his legs?", "end": 305.78}, {"start": 306.78, "text": "Is a chest a part of a body? Yes, a chest is a part of a body.", "end": 313.21}, {"start": 313.21, "text": "Are your eyes part of your face? Yes, my eyes are parts of my face.", "end": 319.21}, {"start": 319.21, "text": "Is your nose over your eyes? No, my nose is under my eyes.", "end": 326.21}, {"start": 326.21, "text": "Are your ears part of your head? Yes, my ears are parts of my head.", "end": 334.9}, {"start": 334.9, "text": "What is the part of a man which is between his head, his arms, and his legs?", "end": 351.69}, {"start": 351.19, "text": "这里把拼写梳理一次,然后让大家再实战运用一次16节课的知识,为17节课做一个影子,也去复习前面5节课的一些东西。", "end": 367.19}, {"start": 366.63, "text": "各位使用頻率到三次,完全徹底理解,明白,用到五次,一輩子都會用,完全母語化,記住頻率的問題。", "end": 377.63}, {"start": 377.63, "text": "Hi, welcome back to Teacher Eric's 17th English lesson for you.", "end": 384.63}, {"start": 384.63, "text": "Welcome back to Teacher Eric's 17th English lesson for you.", "end": 388.63}, {"start": 388.63, "text": "Did you notice that since the seventh English lesson,", "end": 391.63}, {"start": 391.63, "text": "since the 16th and 17th English lessons,", "end": 394.63}, {"start": 394.63, "text": "the frequency of operation has greatly increased.", "end": 396.63}, {"start": 396.63, "text": "Why? Because by this point,", "end": 398.63}, {"start": 398.63, "text": "what you learned in the first 15th English lesson,", "end": 400.63}, {"start": 400.63, "text": "you should have already touched two to three rounds.", "end": 403.63}, {"start": 403.63, "text": "We often say that three rounds of understanding and five rounds of operation are the same.", "end": 408.63}, {"start": 408.63, "text": "Now we are about to enter the fourth and fifth rounds of operation.", "end": 411.63}, {"start": 411.63, "text": "In the 16th lesson, you have already used a lot of knowledge.", "end": 414.63}, {"start": 414.63, "text": "Today we will continue this process,", "end": 416.63}, {"start": 416.63, "text": "and let you get used to the comprehensive use of basic language.", "end": 419.63}, {"start": 419.63, "text": "Don't forget what our 30-day goal is.", "end": 422.63}, {"start": 422.63, "text": "Completely get rid of the most basic, common, high-frequency,", "end": 427.63}, {"start": 427.63, "text": "English句式 and single-word operating frequency and ability.", "end": 432.63}, {"start": 432.63, "text": "At the same time, the most basic 110 and 120 points in the test,", "end": 437.63}, {"start": 438.63, "text": "so that you don't let people grab your whip again", "end": 441.63}, {"start": 441.63, "text": "in terms of basic score or basic ability.", "end": 443.63}, {"start": 443.63, "text": "Okay, let's continue the 17th lesson.", "end": 447.63}, {"start": 447.63, "text": "Let's continue with lesson 17.", "end": 449.63}, {"start": 449.63, "text": "As the second subject of this lesson,", "end": 452.63}, {"start": 452.63, "text": "let's study the position of this dog.", "end": 455.63}, {"start": 455.63, "text": "Did you notice that we are now doing", "end": 458.63}, {"start": 458.63, "text": "comprehensive use of language?", "end": 459.63}, {"start": 459.63, "text": "We need to discuss the main subject,", "end": 461.63}, {"start": 461.63, "text": "their orientation, their space,", "end": 465.63}, {"start": 465.63, "text": "their time logic,", "end": 467.63}, {"start": 467.63, "text": "and some words themselves.", "end": 470.63}, {"start": 470.63, "text": "So what did I say?", "end": 471.63}, {"start": 471.63, "text": "Basic ability.", "end": 472.63}, {"start": 472.63, "text": "This is a small test.", "end": 475.63}, {"start": 475.63, "text": "So basically, where is the dog?", "end": 478.63}, {"start": 478.63, "text": "What is our question?", "end": 479.63}, {"start": 479.63, "text": "Where.", "end": 480.63}, {"start": 480.63, "text": "There is a principle of center of gravity.", "end": 483.63}, {"start": 483.63, "text": "What is the most important component?", "end": 484.63}, {"start": 484.63, "text": "The first word is.", "end": 486.63}, {"start": 486.63, "text": "So why is the question always?", "end": 488.63}, {"start": 488.63, "text": "Put the object of the question in the first place.", "end": 490.63}, {"start": 490.63, "text": "Where is what?", "end": 491.63}, {"start": 491.63, "text": "Where.", "end": 492.63}, {"start": 492.63, "text": "Here.", "end": 493.63}, {"start": 493.63, "text": "There.", "end": 494.63}, {"start": 494.63, "text": "Where.", "end": 495.63}, {"start": 495.63, "text": "Where is the dog?", "end": 496.63}, {"start": 496.63, "text": "A.", "end": 497.63}, {"start": 497.63, "text": "Where is the dog?", "end": 499.63}, {"start": 499.63, "text": "Can you see?", "end": 500.63}, {"start": 500.63, "text": "Can you see?", "end": 501.63}, {"start": 501.63, "text": "The dog is in the room.", "end": 506.68}, {"start": 506.68, "text": "Very good.", "end": 507.68}, {"start": 507.68, "text": "The dog is in the room.", "end": 509.68}, {"start": 509.68, "text": "It is in the room.", "end": 511.68}, {"start": 511.68, "text": "Where is this dog?", "end": 512.68}, {"start": 512.68, "text": "Where is this dog?", "end": 514.68}, {"start": 514.68, "text": "Is it in the room?", "end": 516.68}, {"start": 516.68, "text": "We don't know.", "end": 517.68}, {"start": 517.68, "text": "But we know,", "end": 518.68}, {"start": 518.68, "text": "我们知道什么。", "end": 519.68}, {"start": 519.68, "text": "This dog is at the door.", "end": 524.62}, {"start": 524.62, "text": "It's at the door.", "end": 526.62}, {"start": 526.62, "text": "It's at the door.", "end": 528.62}, {"start": 528.62, "text": "At where?", "end": 529.62}, {"start": 529.62, "text": "The door.", "end": 530.62}, {"start": 530.62, "text": "Where is this dog?", "end": 531.62}, {"start": 531.62, "text": "Where is this dog?", "end": 534.54}, {"start": 534.54, "text": "This dog is on the window or at the window.", "end": 539.54}, {"start": 539.54, "text": "都可以。", "end": 540.54}, {"start": 540.54, "text": "这个情境里两个都说得通。", "end": 542.54}, {"start": 542.54, "text": "它到了窗户的方位。", "end": 545.16}, {"start": 545.16, "text": "At the window.", "end": 547.16}, {"start": 547.16, "text": "或者它趴在窗上。", "end": 549.16}, {"start": 549.16, "text": "On the window.", "end": 550.16}, {"start": 550.16, "text": "What about D?", "end": 551.16}, {"start": 551.16, "text": "This dog.", "end": 552.16}, {"start": 552.16, "text": "Where is this dog?", "end": 555.6}, {"start": 555.6, "text": "This dog is 复习一遍。", "end": 560.86}, {"start": 560.86, "text": "On, under, above.", "end": 566.85}, {"start": 566.85, "text": "Where is the dog?", "end": 571.17}, {"start": 571.17, "text": "对了。", "end": 572.17}, {"start": 572.17, "text": "The dog is under the chair.", "end": 574.76}, {"start": 574.76, "text": "当然,chair也可以说座位。", "end": 576.76}, {"start": 576.76, "text": "Seat.", "end": 577.76}, {"start": 577.76, "text": "The dog is under the seat.", "end": 579.76}, {"start": 579.76, "text": "Very good.", "end": 581.67}, {"start": 581.67, "text": "我们继续。", "end": 582.67}, {"start": 582.67, "text": "This is a table.", "end": 584.67}, {"start": 584.67, "text": "This is a dog.", "end": 585.67}, {"start": 585.67, "text": "Where is it?", "end": 587.67}, {"start": 587.67, "text": "Where is the dog?", "end": 588.67}, {"start": 588.67, "text": "The dog is under the table.", "end": 592.82}, {"start": 592.82, "text": "Is the dog on the table?", "end": 594.82}, {"start": 594.82, "text": "No.", "end": 595.82}, {"start": 595.82, "text": "The dog is not on the table.", "end": 598.82}, {"start": 598.82, "text": "What about this dog?", "end": 601.29}, {"start": 601.29, "text": "Where is this dog?", "end": 603.29}, {"start": 603.29, "text": "This dog is on the table.", "end": 606.29}, {"start": 606.29, "text": "Oh, look at this dog.", "end": 608.29}, {"start": 608.29, "text": "Look at this dog.", "end": 612.29}, {"start": 612.29, "text": "Where is it?", "end": 614.29}, {"start": 614.29, "text": "It is...", "end": 616.82}, {"start": 616.82, "text": "Here's a table.", "end": 617.82}, {"start": 617.82, "text": "Here's a seat.", "end": 618.82}, {"start": 618.82, "text": "Or a chair.", "end": 619.82}, {"start": 619.82, "text": "This dog is between.", "end": 625.9}, {"start": 625.9, "text": "就是走到了或者发展到了。", "end": 628.9}, {"start": 628.9, "text": "或者成长到了。", "end": 631.62}, {"start": 631.62, "text": "它讲究一种存在的动态的存在。", "end": 635.62}, {"start": 635.62, "text": "This dog is between.", "end": 640.14}, {"start": 640.14, "text": "Between 其实是个组合词。", "end": 642.14}, {"start": 642.14, "text": "我们之前有讲过。", "end": 643.14}, {"start": 643.14, "text": "Before, between.", "end": 646.14}, {"start": 646.14, "text": "这类的英语单词。", "end": 647.14}, {"start": 647.14, "text": "它其实是把B跟一个东西组合了。", "end": 650.14}, {"start": 650.14, "text": "Between 显然指的就是两物之间。", "end": 653.14}, {"start": 653.14, "text": "Between the table and the seat.", "end": 657.14}, {"start": 657.14, "text": "And what about this dog?", "end": 658.14}, {"start": 658.14, "text": "This dog is on the seat.", "end": 663.14}, {"start": 663.14, "text": "这个就比较简单了。", "end": 665.14}, {"start": 665.14, "text": "我们通过这里把方位又复习了一次。", "end": 667.14}, {"start": 667.14, "text": "当然这只狗狗可爱极了。", "end": 669.14}, {"start": 669.14, "text": "我太喜欢火柴人的世界了。", "end": 671.14}, {"start": 671.14, "text": "纯净、简单、好理解。", "end": 673.14}, {"start": 673.14, "text": "这也是我们这门课最大的特色。", "end": 676.14}, {"start": 676.14, "text": "在结束这一页之前,我希望让大家把拼写看一下。", "end": 680.14}, {"start": 680.14, "text": "The dog is in the room.", "end": 682.14}, {"start": 682.14, "text": "The dog is at the door.", "end": 684.14}, {"start": 684.14, "text": "The dog is at the window.", "end": 686.14}, {"start": 686.14, "text": "刚刚我们说了on the window也行。", "end": 688.14}, {"start": 688.14, "text": "The dog is under the chair.", "end": 690.14}, {"start": 690.14, "text": "Under the chair.", "end": 691.14}, {"start": 691.14, "text": "The dog is under the table.", "end": 693.14}, {"start": 693.14, "text": "Under the table.", "end": 694.14}, {"start": 694.14, "text": "The dog is on the table.", "end": 697.14}, {"start": 697.14, "text": "On the table.", "end": 698.14}, {"start": 698.14, "text": "The dog is between the chair and the table.", "end": 702.14}, {"start": 702.14, "text": "注意两个并列的东西。", "end": 704.14}, {"start": 704.14, "text": "我们要加一个and。", "end": 706.14}, {"start": 706.14, "text": "这是非常常见的英语。", "end": 707.14}, {"start": 707.14, "text": "要注意运用。", "end": 708.14}, {"start": 708.14, "text": "一旦你用了,前后者就是平等了。", "end": 711.14}, {"start": 711.14, "text": "所以有时候有人问说teacher Eric常句很难讲。", "end": 714.14}, {"start": 714.14, "text": "其实很多人常句就是简单加一个and就完了。", "end": 717.14}, {"start": 717.14, "text": "把前面的主位宾跟后面的主位宾直接并成一句话。", "end": 722.14}, {"start": 722.14, "text": "在此也提醒各位,其实英语里是比较记会常句的。", "end": 726.58}, {"start": 726.58, "text": "其实任何语言的表达,我们都是记会常句的。", "end": 730.58}, {"start": 730.58, "text": "因为你会增加听的人的理解难度。", "end": 733.58}, {"start": 733.58, "text": "所以你们会发现很多书面语他用常句。", "end": 736.58}, {"start": 736.58, "text": "他敢,因为你在看,你比较好理解。", "end": 739.58}, {"start": 739.58, "text": "但在口语中,尽量不要用太长的句。", "end": 742.58}, {"start": 742.58, "text": "如果你要,那你在发音的重心上就要做一个好的区分。", "end": 747.58}, {"start": 747.58, "text": "平时你们听teacher Eric讲话,会重视到我的很多发音。", "end": 750.58}, {"start": 750.58, "text": "会注意到我的很多发音是有起伏的。", "end": 753.58}, {"start": 753.58, "text": "我会把一句常句里的各个要素的重点稍微放一点重音。", "end": 759.58}, {"start": 759.58, "text": "这就是让听的人更好理解话的重点在哪。", "end": 763.58}, {"start": 763.58, "text": "因为真的听常句的时候,老外也好,你们也好,其实是在听重点。", "end": 768.58}, {"start": 768.58, "text": "你想一下是不是这样。", "end": 770.58}, {"start": 770.58, "text": "所以我稍稍微微敲了一下音调这个大门。", "end": 774.58}, {"start": 774.58, "text": "但我说过什么,我们一律用中学,不要专门去上音调课,不要专门去上发音课。", "end": 780.58}, {"start": 780.58, "text": "全部以主课为主。", "end": 783.58}, {"start": 783.58, "text": "最后干嘛?The dog is on the chair。", "end": 787.58}, {"start": 787.58, "text": "回忆一下。", "end": 789.58}, {"start": 789.58, "text": "注意一些简单的拼起来,我们听说读写一次打通。", "end": 793.58}, {"start": 793.58, "text": "在这里提醒所有的考生,你们考试写作文的时候,", "end": 797.58}, {"start": 797.58, "text": "千万不要在这类的地方丢分,包括贯词的a and,", "end": 803.58}, {"start": 803.58, "text": "包括方位词、介词,对吧?", "end": 806.58}, {"start": 806.58, "text": "包括构置的整体性,重点跟不重点要去区分。", "end": 810.58}, {"start": 810.58, "text": "你们经常在这里丢大分,起码一次要丢20分。", "end": 814.58}, {"start": 814.58, "text": "所以为什么这个课程我推荐给任何考生,你现在应该有感觉了。", "end": 819.58}, {"start": 819.58, "text": "如果能排除掉你这些错误,你的整个平均分会稳步提高10来分。", "end": 824.58}, {"start": 825.58, "text": "我们说打底。", "end": 827.58}, {"start": 827.58, "text": "好,What do you see?", "end": 829.58}, {"start": 829.58, "text": "我们进一步。", "end": 831.58}, {"start": 831.58, "text": "这节课很大程度就是去反复巩固和运用,", "end": 835.58}, {"start": 835.58, "text": "也去加深对之前的概念的认知。", "end": 839.58}, {"start": 839.58, "text": "所以他要ask a question。", "end": 841.58}, {"start": 841.58, "text": "注意,第一个词就是问题。", "end": 843.58}, {"start": 843.58, "text": "What do you see?", "end": 846.58}, {"start": 846.58, "text": "做,什么做,你看到。", "end": 849.58}, {"start": 849.58, "text": "So what do you see?", "end": 851.58}, {"start": 851.58, "text": "整个you see就是什么?", "end": 853.58}, {"start": 853.58, "text": "他问的对象。", "end": 855.58}, {"start": 855.58, "text": "What就是什么?", "end": 856.58}, {"start": 856.58, "text": "代词。", "end": 857.58}, {"start": 857.58, "text": "所以他说什么?", "end": 858.58}, {"start": 858.58, "text": "What do you see?", "end": 859.58}, {"start": 859.58, "text": "什么,你看到。", "end": 862.1}, {"start": 862.1, "text": "或者什么做,你看到。", "end": 864.1}, {"start": 864.1, "text": "你们开始去体会英语的一些问句的格式。", "end": 867.1}, {"start": 867.1, "text": "回应的时候我们要说什么?", "end": 869.1}, {"start": 869.1, "text": "I see what?", "end": 871.1}, {"start": 871.1, "text": "感受一下。", "end": 873.1}, {"start": 873.1, "text": "很多人会问为什么要加一个do。", "end": 875.1}, {"start": 875.1, "text": "为什么不能说what you see?", "end": 877.1}, {"start": 877.1, "text": "很多中国人会说什么你看到。", "end": 880.1}, {"start": 880.1, "text": "那这个do的意义在哪里?", "end": 882.76}, {"start": 882.76, "text": "Do you see?", "end": 883.76}, {"start": 883.76, "text": "或者Do not you see?", "end": 885.76}, {"start": 885.76, "text": "他是先对do做了一个组合确认。", "end": 888.76}, {"start": 888.76, "text": "因为what可以是任何东西,", "end": 890.76}, {"start": 890.76, "text": "它限制了是一种行为。", "end": 892.76}, {"start": 892.76, "text": "So what do you see?", "end": 894.76}, {"start": 894.76, "text": "最后you see才是问的这个成分。", "end": 897.76}, {"start": 897.76, "text": "我们多接触这种句式,你慢慢会体会。", "end": 901.26}, {"start": 901.26, "text": "来,What do you see?", "end": 903.26}, {"start": 903.26, "text": "我们这么回答。", "end": 904.26}, {"start": 904.26, "text": "I see a clock, right?", "end": 907.72}, {"start": 907.72, "text": "What time is it?", "end": 909.72}, {"start": 909.72, "text": "What time is it?", "end": 911.72}, {"start": 911.72, "text": "What do you see?", "end": 913.72}, {"start": 913.72, "text": "What time is it?", "end": 915.7}, {"start": 915.7, "text": "It is 4 o'clock.", "end": 917.7}, {"start": 917.7, "text": "The hand of the clock is at 4.", "end": 921.7}, {"start": 921.7, "text": "What do you see?", "end": 922.7}, {"start": 922.7, "text": "I see a man's face.", "end": 926.7}, {"start": 926.7, "text": "注意,man's face。", "end": 929.7}, {"start": 929.7, "text": "这个跟我们常常说的负数或者第三人称单数不是同一个s。", "end": 934.7}, {"start": 934.7, "text": "是一个一撇s,指的是的。", "end": 936.7}, {"start": 936.7, "text": "So the man's face.", "end": 938.7}, {"start": 938.7, "text": "What do you see here?", "end": 939.7}, {"start": 939.7, "text": "I see a woman's face.", "end": 942.29}, {"start": 942.29, "text": "Is she happy?", "end": 945.7}, {"start": 945.7, "text": "She is not happy.", "end": 946.7}, {"start": 946.7, "text": "What do you see here?", "end": 948.7}, {"start": 948.7, "text": "I see a baby.", "end": 950.22}, {"start": 950.22, "text": "The baby's hands, knees, and feet are on the ground.", "end": 957.73}, {"start": 957.73, "text": "或者on the floor.", "end": 958.73}, {"start": 958.73, "text": "我们学过floor, right?", "end": 960.73}, {"start": 960.73, "text": "On the floor.", "end": 961.73}, {"start": 961.73, "text": "The baby is on the floor.", "end": 963.73}, {"start": 963.73, "text": "What do you see here?", "end": 964.73}, {"start": 964.73, "text": "I see two books.", "end": 966.73}, {"start": 966.73, "text": "I see books.", "end": 968.73}, {"start": 968.73, "text": "They are on the shelf?", "end": 971.8}, {"start": 971.8, "text": "I don't know.", "end": 973.49}, {"start": 973.49, "text": "What do you think?", "end": 976.21}, {"start": 976.21, "text": "One book is shut.", "end": 979.34}, {"start": 979.34, "text": "One book is open.", "end": 982.0}, {"start": 982.0, "text": "This book is shut.", "end": 985.46}, {"start": 985.46, "text": "The other book is open.", "end": 987.46}, {"start": 987.46, "text": "The other book is open.", "end": 990.91}, {"start": 990.91, "text": "What do you see?", "end": 991.91}, {"start": 991.91, "text": "I see two women.", "end": 993.91}, {"start": 993.91, "text": "Women,不是我们。", "end": 996.5}, {"start": 996.5, "text": "Women,因为有两个。", "end": 999.5}, {"start": 999.5, "text": "One doesn't have a book.", "end": 1003.07}, {"start": 1003.07, "text": "One has a book.", "end": 1004.07}, {"start": 1004.07, "text": "Have,第三人称has, right?", "end": 1008.07}, {"start": 1008.07, "text": "为什么这里是has,不是have?", "end": 1010.07}, {"start": 1010.07, "text": "我们之前好几节接触过这点, right?", "end": 1013.07}, {"start": 1013.07, "text": "Teacher Eric总是提醒你什么?", "end": 1015.07}, {"start": 1015.07, "text": "涉及到一个第三方单数的时候,", "end": 1018.07}, {"start": 1018.07, "text": "我们会加一个模糊的尾音,", "end": 1020.07}, {"start": 1020.07, "text": "类似于名词的副数, ss.", "end": 1023.07}, {"start": 1023.07, "text": "好多apple, many apples.", "end": 1026.07}, {"start": 1026.07, "text": "那个人做了啥?", "end": 1028.07}, {"start": 1028.07, "text": "她拥有, she has, right?", "end": 1031.07}, {"start": 1031.07, "text": "So she has a book.", "end": 1033.07}, {"start": 1033.07, "text": "她正在干嘛?", "end": 1034.07}, {"start": 1034.07, "text": "她打算干嘛?", "end": 1036.07}, {"start": 1036.07, "text": "干嘛?", "end": 1037.07}, {"start": 1037.07, "text": "把书给另外一个女生。", "end": 1039.07}, {"start": 1039.07, "text": "所以我们说什么?", "end": 1040.07}, {"start": 1040.07, "text": "She is giving,", "end": 1042.07}, {"start": 1042.07, "text": "或者will give the book to her.", "end": 1047.07}, {"start": 1047.07, "text": "She will give the book to her.", "end": 1049.6}, {"start": 1049.6, "text": "或者She is giving the book to her.", "end": 1052.6}, {"start": 1052.6, "text": "如果已经在进行了,怎么说?", "end": 1054.6}, {"start": 1054.6, "text": "Giving, right?", "end": 1056.6}, {"start": 1056.6, "text": "She is giving the book to her.", "end": 1058.6}, {"start": 1058.6, "text": "都可以。", "end": 1059.6}, {"start": 1059.6, "text": "到这个时候,你们已经可以开始活用语言了。", "end": 1062.6}, {"start": 1062.6, "text": "不用太僵死了。", "end": 1064.6}, {"start": 1064.6, "text": "你这么理解是合理的,你就这么去用。", "end": 1067.6}, {"start": 1067.6, "text": "我开始鼓励你们自己表达了。", "end": 1069.6}, {"start": 1069.6, "text": "There, there, here, there.", "end": 1074.6}, {"start": 1074.6, "text": "There are two babies.", "end": 1076.6}, {"start": 1076.6, "text": "One baby is on the floor.", "end": 1079.35}, {"start": 1079.35, "text": "His hands, his knees, and his feet are on the floor.", "end": 1086.82}, {"start": 1086.82, "text": "One baby is standing, stand.", "end": 1091.54}, {"start": 1091.54, "text": "他正在站, standing.", "end": 1094.54}, {"start": 1094.54, "text": "This baby is standing.", "end": 1096.98}, {"start": 1096.98, "text": "This baby is happy.", "end": 1097.98}, {"start": 1097.98, "text": "His arms are up.", "end": 1100.98}, {"start": 1100.98, "text": "He is happy.", "end": 1104.08}, {"start": 1104.08, "text": "This is a drawer.", "end": 1107.61}, {"start": 1107.61, "text": "美国人在念这个时候会顺一点。", "end": 1109.61}, {"start": 1109.61, "text": "Drawer.", "end": 1110.61}, {"start": 1110.61, "text": "当然它的原意是什么?", "end": 1111.61}, {"start": 1111.61, "text": "Draw这个动作。", "end": 1112.61}, {"start": 1112.61, "text": "抽。", "end": 1113.61}, {"start": 1113.61, "text": "中国人也讲什么?", "end": 1114.61}, {"start": 1114.61, "text": "抽屉。", "end": 1115.61}, {"start": 1115.61, "text": "那个抽就是draw。", "end": 1117.61}, {"start": 1117.61, "text": "我们说过什么?", "end": 1118.61}, {"start": 1118.61, "text": "现代英语里一般会说什么?", "end": 1120.61}, {"start": 1120.61, "text": "First, second, third drawer.", "end": 1123.61}, {"start": 1123.61, "text": "当然英国人会说什么?", "end": 1124.61}, {"start": 1124.61, "text": "The chest of the drawer.", "end": 1126.61}, {"start": 1126.61, "text": "中间那一格叫胸。", "end": 1128.61}, {"start": 1128.61, "text": "所以the chest of the drawer,", "end": 1130.61}, {"start": 1130.61, "text": "the chest of teacher Eric.", "end": 1133.04}, {"start": 1133.04, "text": "Yeah, that's a drawer.", "end": 1135.04}, {"start": 1135.04, "text": "不错。", "end": 1136.04}, {"start": 1136.04, "text": "我觉得你们跟上不少了。", "end": 1138.04}, {"start": 1138.04, "text": "如果你没办法形成长句完整句,", "end": 1141.04}, {"start": 1141.04, "text": "多听,你的输入还不够。", "end": 1143.04}, {"start": 1143.04, "text": "如果你可以了,", "end": 1145.04}, {"start": 1145.04, "text": "多去跟teacher Eric打磨一下发音跟拼写。", "end": 1149.04}, {"start": 1149.04, "text": "说到拼写,刚刚的词句,", "end": 1152.04}, {"start": 1152.04, "text": "我们看一下怎么去书写最好。", "end": 1155.04}, {"start": 1155.04, "text": "I see a clock.", "end": 1156.04}, {"start": 1156.04, "text": "第一图是不是个钟?", "end": 1158.47}, {"start": 1158.47, "text": "clock.", "end": 1159.47}, {"start": 1159.47, "text": "I see a man.", "end": 1160.47}, {"start": 1160.47, "text": "我们看到man's face,", "end": 1162.47}, {"start": 1162.47, "text": "那就是一撇。", "end": 1163.47}, {"start": 1163.47, "text": "脸。", "end": 1164.47}, {"start": 1164.47, "text": "face.", "end": 1165.47}, {"start": 1165.47, "text": "I see a woman.", "end": 1166.47}, {"start": 1166.47, "text": "I see a baby.", "end": 1168.45}, {"start": 1168.45, "text": "I see two books.", "end": 1171.14}, {"start": 1171.14, "text": "I see two girls and a book.", "end": 1174.79}, {"start": 1174.79, "text": "这是简单版的。", "end": 1177.54}, {"start": 1177.54, "text": "保证所有人都能上车。", "end": 1179.54}, {"start": 1179.54, "text": "I see two books.", "end": 1180.54}, {"start": 1180.54, "text": "One is shut.", "end": 1183.2}, {"start": 1183.2, "text": "The other one is open.", "end": 1185.2}, {"start": 1185.2, "text": "这都是学过的,其实。", "end": 1186.2}, {"start": 1186.2, "text": "所以teacher Eric把它稍微丰富一点。", "end": 1188.2}, {"start": 1188.2, "text": "当然,你能讲到这样子,", "end": 1190.2}, {"start": 1190.2, "text": "对于很多邻居的人来说,", "end": 1192.2}, {"start": 1192.2, "text": "也算是到一个水平了。", "end": 1194.2}, {"start": 1194.2, "text": "I see two girls and a book.", "end": 1197.2}, {"start": 1197.2, "text": "注意并列。", "end": 1198.2}, {"start": 1198.2, "text": "And, right?", "end": 1199.2}, {"start": 1199.2, "text": "I see two babies.", "end": 1201.2}, {"start": 1201.2, "text": "I see a chest of drawers.", "end": 1203.2}, {"start": 1203.2, "text": "这是最基本的回答。", "end": 1205.2}, {"start": 1205.2, "text": "I see something.", "end": 1207.2}, {"start": 1207.2, "text": "如果你能力到了,", "end": 1208.2}, {"start": 1208.2, "text": "或者你是学生,", "end": 1209.2}, {"start": 1209.2, "text": "尽量讲到teacher Eric的水平。", "end": 1211.2}, {"start": 1211.2, "text": "你们离雅诗六分又接近一步了。", "end": 1214.2}, {"start": 1214.2, "text": "What is he saying?", "end": 1216.2}, {"start": 1216.2, "text": "What is he saying?", "end": 1219.08}, {"start": 1219.08, "text": "他正在说。", "end": 1220.08}, {"start": 1220.08, "text": "What is he saying?", "end": 1222.08}, {"start": 1222.08, "text": "刚刚我们是不是讨论过", "end": 1224.08}, {"start": 1224.08, "text": "What do you do?", "end": 1225.08}, {"start": 1225.08, "text": "What do you see?", "end": 1227.08}, {"start": 1227.08, "text": "所以这也是这个句式。", "end": 1229.08}, {"start": 1229.08, "text": "What is?", "end": 1230.08}, {"start": 1230.08, "text": "什么存在?", "end": 1232.08}, {"start": 1232.08, "text": "什么在?", "end": 1234.08}, {"start": 1234.08, "text": "He saying,", "end": 1236.09}, {"start": 1236.09, "text": "他正在说。", "end": 1237.09}, {"start": 1237.09, "text": "什么在,他正在说。", "end": 1239.09}, {"start": 1239.09, "text": "老外是重心放前面。", "end": 1241.09}, {"start": 1241.09, "text": "所以问的代词,", "end": 1243.09}, {"start": 1243.09, "text": "问的内容,", "end": 1244.09}, {"start": 1244.09, "text": "以及最后内容的具体展开。", "end": 1246.09}, {"start": 1246.09, "text": "刚刚也是What do?", "end": 1248.09}, {"start": 1248.09, "text": "做啥?", "end": 1249.09}, {"start": 1249.09, "text": "你看到you see。", "end": 1251.09}, {"start": 1251.09, "text": "You see是do的一个什么?", "end": 1253.09}, {"start": 1253.09, "text": "展开。", "end": 1254.55}, {"start": 1254.55, "text": "What is he saying?", "end": 1256.55}, {"start": 1256.55, "text": "所以他这里问的是,", "end": 1258.27}, {"start": 1258.27, "text": "他说话这个状态。", "end": 1260.27}, {"start": 1260.27, "text": "What is it?", "end": 1261.27}, {"start": 1261.27, "text": "对吧?", "end": 1262.27}, {"start": 1262.27, "text": "这个状态具体是啥?", "end": 1264.27}, {"start": 1264.27, "text": "也就是什么?", "end": 1265.27}, {"start": 1265.27, "text": "他正在说什么。", "end": 1267.27}, {"start": 1267.27, "text": "All right?", "end": 1268.27}, {"start": 1268.27, "text": "用中文就是导序过来。", "end": 1270.27}, {"start": 1270.27, "text": "中文有没有重心前置原则?", "end": 1272.27}, {"start": 1272.27, "text": "有时候也有。", "end": 1273.27}, {"start": 1273.27, "text": "尤其在口语里会呈现。", "end": 1275.27}, {"start": 1275.27, "text": "说的啥呀他。", "end": 1277.27}, {"start": 1277.27, "text": "对吧?", "end": 1278.27}, {"start": 1278.27, "text": "如果你是北方人,", "end": 1279.27}, {"start": 1279.27, "text": "他们在讲话时也跟你老外一样,", "end": 1282.27}, {"start": 1282.27, "text": "会干嘛?", "end": 1283.27}, {"start": 1283.27, "text": "把重心前置。", "end": 1284.27}, {"start": 1284.27, "text": "所以这不是英语独有的现象。", "end": 1286.27}, {"start": 1286.27, "text": "但在英诺大陆的表音语言里面,", "end": 1290.27}, {"start": 1290.27, "text": "这是一个比较总体的现象。", "end": 1292.27}, {"start": 1292.27, "text": "所以大家一定要记住这个原则。", "end": 1294.27}, {"start": 1294.27, "text": "我们具体回答看看。", "end": 1295.27}, {"start": 1295.27, "text": "What is he saying?", "end": 1296.27}, {"start": 1296.27, "text": "These are my ears.", "end": 1301.27}, {"start": 1301.27, "text": "This is my mouth.", "end": 1304.27}, {"start": 1304.27, "text": "These are my eyes.", "end": 1307.27}, {"start": 1307.27, "text": "This is my thumb.", "end": 1310.27}, {"start": 1310.27, "text": "This finger is between these fingers.", "end": 1315.96}, {"start": 1315.96, "text": "Between", "end": 1317.96}, {"start": 1317.96, "text": "具体一点。", "end": 1318.96}, {"start": 1318.96, "text": "你们能做这个动作吗?", "end": 1320.96}, {"start": 1320.96, "text": "Between", "end": 1321.96}, {"start": 1321.96, "text": "在他们之间。", "end": 1322.96}, {"start": 1322.96, "text": "Between these fingers.", "end": 1324.96}, {"start": 1324.96, "text": "This is my nose.", "end": 1329.96}, {"start": 1329.96, "text": "This is my head", "end": 1330.96}, {"start": 1330.96, "text": "或者", "end": 1331.96}, {"start": 1331.96, "text": "This is my hair", "end": 1332.96}, {"start": 1332.96, "text": "都可以。", "end": 1333.96}, {"start": 1333.96, "text": "This is my face.", "end": 1336.49}, {"start": 1336.49, "text": "顺便提醒一个。", "end": 1338.49}, {"start": 1338.49, "text": "This is my chin.", "end": 1339.49}, {"start": 1339.49, "text": "This is my neck.", "end": 1342.18}, {"start": 1342.18, "text": "And this is my body.", "end": 1343.18}, {"start": 1343.18, "text": "顺便复习一下。", "end": 1344.18}, {"start": 1344.18, "text": "好,我们看一下拼写。", "end": 1346.18}, {"start": 1346.18, "text": "He is saying。", "end": 1348.18}, {"start": 1348.18, "text": "注意,如果我们完整回答,", "end": 1350.18}, {"start": 1350.18, "text": "他在说,那就跟中文一样。", "end": 1352.18}, {"start": 1352.18, "text": "他说。", "end": 1353.18}, {"start": 1353.18, "text": "注意后面有个逗号,", "end": 1354.18}, {"start": 1354.18, "text": "然后才是上瘾。", "end": 1356.18}, {"start": 1356.18, "text": "中国人会用冒号,对吧?", "end": 1359.18}, {"start": 1359.18, "text": "老外用一个逗号再去接说的话。", "end": 1362.18}, {"start": 1363.18, "text": "老外比较重视语言的片段,", "end": 1365.18}, {"start": 1365.18, "text": "没有那么多复杂的符号。", "end": 1367.18}, {"start": 1367.18, "text": "在现代的英语书写里,", "end": 1369.18}, {"start": 1369.18, "text": "甚至这个结构都没了,", "end": 1371.18}, {"start": 1371.18, "text": "直接用写体或者出题。", "end": 1373.18}, {"start": 1373.18, "text": "他们是不断努力在简化,", "end": 1375.18}, {"start": 1375.18, "text": "让更多人能接受这个阅读体验。", "end": 1378.18}, {"start": 1378.18, "text": "所以语言在发展,", "end": 1379.18}, {"start": 1379.18, "text": "各位要记住。", "end": 1381.18}, {"start": 1381.18, "text": "He is saying", "end": 1382.18}, {"start": 1382.18, "text": "These are my ears.", "end": 1383.18}, {"start": 1383.18, "text": "He is saying", "end": 1384.83}, {"start": 1384.83, "text": "This is my mouth.", "end": 1386.83}, {"start": 1386.83, "text": "He is saying", "end": 1388.42}, {"start": 1388.42, "text": "These are my eyes.", "end": 1390.42}, {"start": 1390.42, "text": "He is saying", "end": 1391.42}, {"start": 1391.42, "text": "This is my thumb.", "end": 1393.42}, {"start": 1393.42, "text": "He is saying", "end": 1395.37}, {"start": 1395.37, "text": "This finger is between these fingers.", "end": 1399.37}, {"start": 1399.37, "text": "This finger is between these fingers.", "end": 1404.37}, {"start": 1404.37, "text": "对吧?刚说的。", "end": 1405.37}, {"start": 1405.37, "text": "He is saying", "end": 1406.37}, {"start": 1406.37, "text": "This is my nose.", "end": 1408.37}, {"start": 1408.37, "text": "He is saying", "end": 1409.37}, {"start": 1409.37, "text": "This is my hair.", "end": 1411.37}, {"start": 1411.37, "text": "This is my hair.", "end": 1412.37}, {"start": 1412.37, "text": "He is saying", "end": 1414.18}, {"start": 1414.18, "text": "This is my head.", "end": 1416.18}, {"start": 1416.18, "text": "或者This is my face.", "end": 1418.18}, {"start": 1418.18, "text": "所以怎么去表述他在说什么。", "end": 1421.18}, {"start": 1421.18, "text": "这里有一个很好的体现。", "end": 1423.18}, {"start": 1423.18, "text": "当然这是经典英语的体现。", "end": 1425.18}, {"start": 1425.18, "text": "就像我刚刚说的,", "end": 1426.18}, {"start": 1426.18, "text": "你现在再去买一些书,", "end": 1428.18}, {"start": 1428.18, "text": "它已经不会这么呈现了。", "end": 1429.18}, {"start": 1429.18, "text": "很多是写体、单引号、各种情况。", "end": 1433.18}, {"start": 1433.18, "text": "这个我们不再次展开。", "end": 1434.18}, {"start": 1434.18, "text": "在第17节课收尾之前,", "end": 1437.18}, {"start": 1437.18, "text": "我还是提醒各位,", "end": 1439.18}, {"start": 1439.18, "text": "你们已经开始做完整的画面、", "end": 1441.18}, {"start": 1441.18, "text": "情境跟事件的描述了。", "end": 1443.18}, {"start": 1443.18, "text": "比起你们在第一节课的状态,", "end": 1446.18}, {"start": 1446.18, "text": "现在我们已经进入到深水区了。", "end": 1449.18}, {"start": 1449.18, "text": "不要忘了,", "end": 1450.18}, {"start": 1450.18, "text": "如果你是一个想考雅思的人,", "end": 1452.18}, {"start": 1452.18, "text": "能完整描绘一件事情,", "end": 1454.18}, {"start": 1454.18, "text": "它的事实是最基本的能力,", "end": 1457.18}, {"start": 1457.18, "text": "也是流畅度的来源。", "end": 1459.18}, {"start": 1459.18, "text": "你想拿6分,", "end": 1460.18}, {"start": 1460.18, "text": "流畅度永远是第一。", "end": 1462.18}, {"start": 1462.18, "text": "基本功一个错误都不能犯。", "end": 1464.18}, {"start": 1464.18, "text": "如果你想高考,", "end": 1466.97}, {"start": 1466.97, "text": "一样的,", "end": 1467.97}, {"start": 1467.97, "text": "即便你现在是班里前几名,", "end": 1469.97}, {"start": 1469.97, "text": "你未来要去考试,", "end": 1471.97}, {"start": 1471.97, "text": "你能不能保证你的基本功,", "end": 1473.97}, {"start": 1473.97, "text": "不论是书写还是说,", "end": 1475.97}, {"start": 1475.97, "text": "都可以保证正确率,", "end": 1477.97}, {"start": 1477.97, "text": "保持流畅性,", "end": 1478.97}, {"start": 1478.97, "text": "并且马上落笔,", "end": 1479.97}, {"start": 1479.97, "text": "马上表达清楚一件事情。", "end": 1482.97}, {"start": 1482.97, "text": "这个是背诵和能力的差别,", "end": 1485.97}, {"start": 1485.97, "text": "所以我们在这里小小的体验一下,", "end": 1488.97}, {"start": 1488.97, "text": "我可以开始开口讲完整的英语了。", "end": 1491.97}, {"start": 1491.97, "text": "好,", "end": 1492.97}, {"start": 1492.97, "text": "那这个情境我们接触过好几次了,", "end": 1494.97}, {"start": 1494.97, "text": "要怎么去描述呢?", "end": 1496.97}, {"start": 1496.97, "text": "再先给你们两秒钟的时间,", "end": 1498.97}, {"start": 1498.97, "text": "去看一眼,", "end": 1500.97}, {"start": 1500.97, "text": "然后尝试一下。", "end": 1506.28}, {"start": 1506.28, "text": "好,", "end": 1508.0}, {"start": 1508.0, "text": "This is a room,", "end": 1509.0}, {"start": 1509.0, "text": "先说大的,right?", "end": 1510.0}, {"start": 1510.0, "text": "In the room,", "end": 1511.43}, {"start": 1511.43, "text": "There is a boy and a girl,", "end": 1513.43}, {"start": 1513.43, "text": "They are at the window,", "end": 1517.28}, {"start": 1517.28, "text": "They are looking outside,", "end": 1520.81}, {"start": 1520.81, "text": "注意,", "end": 1521.81}, {"start": 1521.81, "text": "这些都是进行中的,", "end": 1522.81}, {"start": 1522.81, "text": "所以我说looking,", "end": 1523.81}, {"start": 1523.81, "text": "What do they see?", "end": 1528.24}, {"start": 1528.24, "text": "We don't know,", "end": 1529.24}, {"start": 1529.24, "text": "给你们几秒钟,", "end": 1530.24}, {"start": 1530.24, "text": "自己描绘这个画面。", "end": 1532.24}, {"start": 1532.24, "text": "This is a clock,", "end": 1536.23}, {"start": 1536.23, "text": "It is on a table,", "end": 1539.02}, {"start": 1539.02, "text": "The clock is on a table,", "end": 1541.8}, {"start": 1541.8, "text": "The time,", "end": 1544.16}, {"start": 1544.16, "text": "The time is 4 o'clock,", "end": 1548.22}, {"start": 1548.22, "text": "It is 4 o'clock,", "end": 1551.22}, {"start": 1551.22, "text": "Very good,", "end": 1554.5}, {"start": 1554.5, "text": "好啦,", "end": 1555.5}, {"start": 1555.5, "text": "现在情境从简单的情境,", "end": 1557.5}, {"start": 1557.5, "text": "变成大的情境了,", "end": 1559.5}, {"start": 1559.5, "text": "我们能不能仍然保持流畅性?", "end": 1562.5}, {"start": 1562.5, "text": "Let's try,", "end": 1563.5}, {"start": 1563.5, "text": "This is a room,", "end": 1567.18}, {"start": 1567.18, "text": "It is in a house,", "end": 1570.62}, {"start": 1570.62, "text": "In the room,", "end": 1571.62}, {"start": 1571.62, "text": "There is a door,", "end": 1573.91}, {"start": 1573.91, "text": "There is a picture on the wall,", "end": 1580.59}, {"start": 1580.59, "text": "There are two seats on the floor,", "end": 1583.59}, {"start": 1583.59, "text": "The picture is above,", "end": 1588.18}, {"start": 1588.18, "text": "或者on top of the seats,", "end": 1592.83}, {"start": 1592.83, "text": "The seats are under the picture,", "end": 1595.83}, {"start": 1595.83, "text": "The door is open,", "end": 1599.7}, {"start": 1599.7, "text": "On the wall,", "end": 1601.84}, {"start": 1601.84, "text": "There are two windows,", "end": 1604.84}, {"start": 1604.84, "text": "One window is open,", "end": 1607.78}, {"start": 1607.78, "text": "The other window is shut,", "end": 1611.98}, {"start": 1611.98, "text": "那当然,", "end": 1612.98}, {"start": 1612.98, "text": "我们学什么东西之上,", "end": 1614.98}, {"start": 1614.98, "text": "有很多说法,", "end": 1616.98}, {"start": 1616.98, "text": "如果我说under,", "end": 1618.98}, {"start": 1618.98, "text": "我也可以说over,", "end": 1619.98}, {"start": 1619.98, "text": "直接说反一次,", "end": 1621.98}, {"start": 1621.98, "text": "刚刚Teacher Eric提醒你们,", "end": 1623.98}, {"start": 1623.98, "text": "你既可以说它是on the wall,", "end": 1625.98}, {"start": 1625.98, "text": "It is on the wall above the chairs,", "end": 1627.98}, {"start": 1627.98, "text": "也可以说It is on the wall over the chairs,", "end": 1631.98}, {"start": 1631.98, "text": "做一个小小的归纳总结,", "end": 1634.98}, {"start": 1634.98, "text": "往往一个事情有很多说法,", "end": 1636.98}, {"start": 1636.98, "text": "全看你的表达侧重点,", "end": 1638.98}, {"start": 1638.98, "text": "你们现在可以开始", "end": 1640.98}, {"start": 1640.98, "text": "灵活的运用自己已知的语言,", "end": 1642.98}, {"start": 1642.98, "text": "但是一定要注意什么,", "end": 1644.98}, {"start": 1644.98, "text": "构具要完整,", "end": 1645.98}, {"start": 1645.98, "text": "流畅度,", "end": 1646.98}, {"start": 1646.98, "text": "清晰度,", "end": 1647.98}, {"start": 1647.98, "text": "永远排第一。", "end": 1648.98}, {"start": 1648.98, "text": "最后这个画面,", "end": 1649.98}, {"start": 1649.98, "text": "就是对刚刚第16节课,", "end": 1651.98}, {"start": 1651.98, "text": "新接触的一些单词的总结,", "end": 1654.98}, {"start": 1654.98, "text": "也是我们这次复习的最后一章。", "end": 1657.98}, {"start": 1657.48, "text": "让我们试试。", "end": 1659.48}, {"start": 1659.48, "text": "这是一个男人。", "end": 1661.48}, {"start": 1663.48, "text": "他的手指在脸上。", "end": 1666.48}, {"start": 1666.48, "text": "脸。", "end": 1668.48}, {"start": 1669.48, "text": "他的眼睛。", "end": 1671.48}, {"start": 1671.48, "text": "他的眼睛是什么?", "end": 1673.48}, {"start": 1673.48, "text": "一个眼睛是开的。", "end": 1677.48}, {"start": 1677.48, "text": "另一个眼睛是闭的。", "end": 1681.48}, {"start": 1681.48, "text": "The man has no hair.", "end": 1684.48}, {"start": 1684.67, "text": "差不多。", "end": 1685.67}, {"start": 1685.67, "text": "好,我们说过什么,", "end": 1687.67}, {"start": 1687.67, "text": "听说读写要一次打尽,", "end": 1689.67}, {"start": 1689.67, "text": "所以我们趁热,", "end": 1690.67}, {"start": 1690.67, "text": "趁正在思考这些语言的奇迹,", "end": 1692.67}, {"start": 1692.67, "text": "以及让大脑巩固一次他们的书写,", "end": 1694.67}, {"start": 1694.67, "text": "顺便把阅读和书写也带进来。", "end": 1697.67}, {"start": 1697.67, "text": "你能不能通过纯文字,", "end": 1699.67}, {"start": 1699.67, "text": "去想象这些情景,", "end": 1701.67}, {"start": 1701.67, "text": "我们反过来试一下。", "end": 1703.67}, {"start": 1714.01, "text": "是不是刚刚的画面。", "end": 1715.01}, {"start": 1721.99, "text": "teacher刚还补了一句。", "end": 1724.62}, {"start": 1724.62, "text": "先说大的。", "end": 1725.62}, {"start": 1725.12, "text": "It is four o'clock.", "end": 1726.2}, {"start": 1728.72, "text": "I see a room.", "end": 1729.8}, {"start": 1730.36, "text": "先说大的。", "end": 1731.28}, {"start": 1731.44, "text": "Right?", "end": 1731.88}, {"start": 1732.32, "text": "It has two seats in it.", "end": 1733.84}, {"start": 1735.84, "text": "It has two windows and a door.", "end": 1737.88}, {"start": 1739.28, "text": "One of the windows is open.", "end": 1741.48}, {"start": 1742.28, "text": "The other window is shut.", "end": 1744.56}, {"start": 1745.44, "text": "One of the windows is open.", "end": 1747.44}, {"start": 1748.2, "text": "The other window is shut.", "end": 1750.16}, {"start": 1752.2, "text": "The door of the room is open.", "end": 1754.64}, {"start": 1755.12, "text": "The door was open.", "end": 1757.12}, {"start": 1757.12, "text": "The door of the room is open.", "end": 1761.12}, {"start": 1761.61, "text": "注意of的使用啊。", "end": 1762.61}, {"start": 1766.1, "text": "A picture is on the wall.", "end": 1768.1}, {"start": 1768.1, "text": "It is over the seats.", "end": 1770.1}, {"start": 1770.1, "text": "The seats are under the picture.", "end": 1773.1}, {"start": 1773.1, "text": "补充一句。", "end": 1774.1}, {"start": 1774.1, "text": "各位语言是可以活用的,", "end": 1776.1}, {"start": 1776.1, "text": "不要去背,不要去抄。", "end": 1778.1}, {"start": 1778.1, "text": "但是通过这个干嘛,", "end": 1779.1}, {"start": 1779.1, "text": "去锻炼,做一次小循环。", "end": 1782.7}, {"start": 1782.7, "text": "I see a man.", "end": 1783.7}, {"start": 1783.7, "text": "He has his finger on his chin.", "end": 1787.22}, {"start": 1787.22, "text": "His finger is on his chin.", "end": 1789.22}, {"start": 1789.22, "text": "He has a finger.", "end": 1791.69}, {"start": 1791.69, "text": "The finger is on his chin.", "end": 1793.69}, {"start": 1793.69, "text": "He has his finger on his chin.", "end": 1797.5}, {"start": 1797.5, "text": "One of his eyes is open.", "end": 1799.5}, {"start": 1799.5, "text": "The other eye is shut.", "end": 1802.06}, {"start": 1802.06, "text": "His mouth is shut.", "end": 1804.69}, {"start": 1804.69, "text": "He has no hair on his head.", "end": 1808.76}, {"start": 1808.76, "text": "所以可以强调什么?", "end": 1810.51}, {"start": 1810.51, "text": "His mouth is shut too.", "end": 1813.07}, {"start": 1813.07, "text": "往往你想怎么说都行。", "end": 1814.07}, {"start": 1814.07, "text": "你刚刚那个画面,", "end": 1815.07}, {"start": 1815.07, "text": "你甚至可以把我们学过的什么", "end": 1817.07}, {"start": 1817.07, "text": "between带进去,对吧?", "end": 1819.07}, {"start": 1819.07, "text": "His nose is between his eyes and his mouth.", "end": 1822.07}, {"start": 1822.07, "text": "想起来了吗?", "end": 1824.07}, {"start": 1824.07, "text": "所以现在开始,", "end": 1825.07}, {"start": 1825.07, "text": "我已经开始慢慢慢慢把表达", "end": 1828.07}, {"start": 1828.07, "text": "和自主表达表意。", "end": 1830.07}, {"start": 1830.07, "text": "表意,作为你们学习的要求。", "end": 1833.07}, {"start": 1833.07, "text": "这是这次其中总结的", "end": 1835.07}, {"start": 1835.07, "text": "最重要的心得。", "end": 1836.07}, {"start": 1836.07, "text": "因为接下来,", "end": 1837.07}, {"start": 1837.07, "text": "从第18节到第30节,", "end": 1839.07}, {"start": 1839.07, "text": "我们的语言会越来越丰富,", "end": 1841.07}, {"start": 1841.07, "text": "文段会越来越长,", "end": 1843.07}, {"start": 1843.07, "text": "运用会越来越多。", "end": 1845.07}, {"start": 1845.07, "text": "到30节结束的时候,", "end": 1847.07}, {"start": 1847.07, "text": "你要去写一个小说,", "end": 1849.07}, {"start": 1849.07, "text": "或者去完整描绘一段话。", "end": 1851.07}, {"start": 1851.07, "text": "到那个时候,", "end": 1852.07}, {"start": 1852.07, "text": "过雅诗,或者去考试,去面试,", "end": 1857.07}, {"start": 1857.07, "text": "都会开始变得得心应手。", "end": 1859.07}, {"start": 1859.07, "text": "I will see you in lesson 18.", "end": 1862.07}]}